  "body": "### Summary\n\nAs a contributor, I want the app test job to be deterministic, so that a red run means a real failure.\n\n`MessageListSplitTests/aCancelledSearchDoesNotUndoWhatWasReadMeanwhile()` (`App/SwiftHFRTests/Messages/MessageListSplitTests.swift`) failed on #500 at run 42179623121, whose diff touches no MP code, and passed on the re-run.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] The test waits on a condition, not on timing (see #467, #468).\n- [ ] App job green.",
